flowchart TD
  C[Git Commit] --> CI[CI tests and scans]
  CI --> I[Push immutable image to ACR]
  I --> R[Create Green Revision]
  R --> L[Assign Green Label]
  L --> H[Wait for Readiness]
  H --> S[Smoke Test Green URL]
  S --> D[Check Datadog Signals]
  D -->|Healthy| P[Promote]
  P --> T[Shift Traffic to Green]
  T --> E[Deployment Event]
  D -->|Unhealthy| K[Keep Blue at 100 percent]
  T -->|Regression| RB[Rollback to Blue]
